    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing, it never actually breaks. it just resets. the guilt is so heavy every single time and it feels like there's no light at the end of the tunnel. sometimes i wonder if the cycle is all there is. like, is there even a point to keeps going through this just to end up back at zero?",
